#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/depending-on-a-crate.md:6
msgid "Depending on a Crate"
msgstr ""

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/depending-on-a-crate.md:8
msgid ""
"Once you've added a third-party crate and generated build rules, depending "
"on a crate is simple. Find your `rust_static_library` target, and add a "
"`dep` on the `:lib` target within your crate."
msgstr ""

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/depending-on-a-crate.md:12
msgid "Specifically,"
msgstr ""

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/depending-on-a-crate.md:14
msgid ""
"```bob\n"
"                     +------------+      +----------------------+\n"
"\"//third_party/rust\" | crate name | \"/v\" | major semver version | \":"
"lib\"\n"
"                     +------------+      +----------------------+\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/depending-on-a-crate.md:20
msgid "For instance,"
msgstr ""

#: src/chromium/adding-third-party-crates/depending-on-a-crate.md:22
msgid ""
"```gn\n"
"rust_static_library(\"my_rust_lib\") {\n"
"  crate_root = \"lib.rs\"\n"
"  sources = [ \"lib.rs\" ]\n"
"  deps = [ \"//third_party/rust/example_rust_crate/v1:lib\" ]\n"
"}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
